WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
In Finish, open Watermark.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Enter the watermark text in Setup.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Review Placement and adjust Appearance.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Choose the colour, then Save & close.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.670
Check the watermark on the document pages.
